      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "The cover, title and copyright pages of the 2022 WHO technical brief on differentiated and simplified pre-exposure prophylaxis (PrEP) for HIV prevention, with ISBNs and licence terms. It gives the suggested citation and disclaimers. A table of contents lists sections on delivering PrEP, research gaps and annexes on HIV self-testing modelling in Kenya, a global PrEP provider study and PrEP for people who inject drugs.",
