      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "The acknowledgements of the technical brief on differentiated and simplified PrEP, listing external contributors from research institutions, programmes and organizations in many countries. It notes grant funding from Unitaid, the Bill & Melinda Gates Foundation and USAID.",
